{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Become a quail and save your chicks!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scurry across multiple lanes of traffic, hatch eggs and collect quail babies that follow you.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <i>The more you have the harder it is to not get hit!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398430/extras/QuailGif2Redo.gif?t=1745097843\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Can you keep them safe?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel across various levels with unique obstacles and challenges to overcome! <br><br><strong>Dash</strong> to get across roads faster, but be careful, if you dash too much your quail will panic! <br><br>You can also use your quail's <strong>Call</strong> ability to bring your babies closer to you and out of harm's way.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398430/extras/QuailGif1Redo.gif?t=1745097843\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <strong>Collect hats and earn high scores!</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn an award for the amount of quail you rescue and collect cosmetic hats! Reach new high scores and earn Steam Achievements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398430/extras/QuailGifHatsRedo.gif?t=1745097843\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3398430?t=1745097843","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3398430?t=1745097843","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398430/07e4843924507174ff4fe77ed65002b37fa1942f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745097843","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.